<title>UK: Senior Engineering buys US aerospace tech co.</title>
<headline>Senior Engineering buys US aerospace tech co.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Senior Engineering Group Plc said on Monday its Senior Flexonics unit had conditionally agreed to buy the Ketema A&amp;E division from U.S. group  Ketema Inc for about 12.5 million stg cash.</p>
</text>
